Output5Using log base 10 function - O(1) Time and O(1) Space We can use log10(logarithm of base 10) to count the number of digits of positive numbers (logarithm is not defined for negative numbers). For negative numbers, first take the absolute value of n, since logarithm is not defined for negative values.Digit count of n = floor(log10(n) + 1) 
